p('Figure 4. Offline prototype pipeline. It is not invoked by the transfer API.','c')
sub('14.4 Explicit scope limits')
p('There is no bank connector, learned response distribution, incremental solver cache or globally optimal multi-query planner. External withdrawals/re-entry, FX, fees, overdrafts and overlapping source cohorts are outside scope. A query cannot treat an unobservable internal fungible allocation as obtainable evidence. The current synthetic query experiment ties a simple reachability baseline; no superiority claim is supported.')
